{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01221",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.55,
      "end_seconds": 5.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Come in, have a seat by the the desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.39,
      "end_seconds": 11.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Yeah, good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 12.39,
      "end_seconds": 16.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Um, doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.35,
      "end_seconds": 27.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit. So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 28.45,
      "end_seconds": 36.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, we came because of a cut on my finger"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.88,
      "end_seconds": 41.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.56,
      "end_seconds": 51.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.92,
      "text": "let me think, you know, it's bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day for the heart rhythm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 52.22,
      "end_seconds": 57.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.62,
      "end_seconds": 63.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "okay have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.76,
      "end_seconds": 70.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Okay, so not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.59,
      "end_seconds": 81.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "I mean, it's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a little pink tablet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.95,
      "end_seconds": 84.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.42,
      "end_seconds": 97.72,
      "duration_seconds": 12.3,
      "text": "I mean, uh, for the knee pain, I believe. My husband sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.67,
      "end_seconds": 102.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "So, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.65,
      "end_seconds": 107.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "About... well, two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.98,
      "end_seconds": 115.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "And, And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 115.58,
      "end_seconds": 121.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.19,
      "end_seconds": 125.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "I, I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.15,
      "end_seconds": 131.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "that's fine, one at a time i'll ask about everything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 131.78,
      "end_seconds": 133.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.45,
      "end_seconds": 138.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Have you had any numbness or dirty blade?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.92,
      "end_seconds": 155.0,
      "duration_seconds": 14.08,
      "text": "well, um, no, no numbness, no dirty blade. I did have a little bleeding at one point, but that went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.74,
      "end_seconds": 159.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.35,
      "end_seconds": 162.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.59,
      "end_seconds": 165.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.35,
      "end_seconds": 170.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Nothing there, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.77,
      "end_seconds": 191.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.47,
      "end_seconds": 198.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Well, just a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.0,
      "end_seconds": 204.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.0,
      "end_seconds": 212.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "An irregular heartbeat, for two years. I've got arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.77,
      "end_seconds": 215.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.25,
      "end_seconds": 224.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "Alright, an irregular heartbeat, that matches what I have here. Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.41,
      "end_seconds": 230.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.04,
      "end_seconds": 233.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.69,
      "end_seconds": 238.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.26,
      "end_seconds": 243.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.0,
      "end_seconds": 251.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Okay, so I'm allergic to amoxicillin, I get a rash all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 252.97,
      "end_seconds": 266.58,
      "duration_seconds": 13.61,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Height 175 centimetres, BP is 118 over 76, pulse is 81 beats a minute, BMI works out to 18.9, weight 58 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.24,
      "end_seconds": 267.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.61,
      "end_seconds": 274.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.85,
      "end_seconds": 277.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.55,
      "end_seconds": 293.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "It's a clean shallow cut, no longer bleeding, and the finger moves normally."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.79,
      "end_seconds": 307.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "Alright, you can sit up now. Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is a minor clean wound that needs only dressing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.63,
      "end_seconds": 311.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Um, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.78,
      "end_seconds": 321.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.92,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a minor clean wound that needs only dressing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.41,
      "end_seconds": 354.57,
      "duration_seconds": 14.16,
      "text": "I'll close it with adhesive strips and keep it dry for two days. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.61,
      "end_seconds": 359.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Um, thank you, that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.25,
      "end_seconds": 375.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the finger turns red, hot or swollen, call us the same day or go to to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.28,
      "end_seconds": 378.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.63,
      "end_seconds": 386.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.67,
      "end_seconds": 393.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Actually, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.11,
      "end_seconds": 396.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}